 "descripcion": "At Hollow Pines the only thing that works is one forum thread. The faceless man has one piece of advice. Then a friendly stranger offers Nora a ride.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you take the ride?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Part two. The *faceless man* knows Nora's name.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She backs away. He doesn't move. He just talks.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The next bus comes when you stop looking for it.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then he points at the forest, and goes quiet.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "No calls, no maps. Only one thing still works: *the forum*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Strangers reply in real time. Some say it's a prank. One says: walk along the road.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nora walks. The asphalt feels soft, like it's breathing.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Somewhere in the trees, someone starts beating a *drum*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Slow at first. Then matching her footsteps.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the next part is when she made her mistake.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Headlights. A car pulls up beside her and the window rolls down.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A kind man in a suit smiles. Lost? I'll drive you to town.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her battery is at *nine percent*. Her feet are bleeding.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She types: a man is offering me a ride. Should I go?",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The forum goes silent for a full minute.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then a new user answers, an account made just now.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Don't get in. That's how I got here.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "The passenger door opens on its own. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
